This directory contains Attrition's independent in-game cockpit hooks and
related files for Fowl Engine 2.0 / Attrition servers.

It is not derived from a licensed Vector Strike in-game cockpit. No Vector
cockpit license was granted for Attrition use. This package is outside the
scope of bfweb/LICENSE (dashboard / Vector-derived grant).

The companion cockpit web UI under bfweb is covered by bfweb/LICENSE.cockpit.

No open-source license is granted. Use is permitted only under a separate
written agreement with the copyright holder (Attrition Fowl Engine 2.0
